---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Enterprise Decision Console | Supply Chain Command | Ceres"
  description="The Ceres Enterprise Console gives operations teams a unified command center — automated exception handling, real-time global order visibility, and AI-powered demand forecasting."
>
  <main class="min-h-screen">

    <!-- HERO -->
    <section class="relative pt-20 pb-12 px-6 lg:px-12 border-b border-outline-variant/10">
      <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto grid lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-start">
        <div class="lg:col-span-7">
          <h1 class="font-headline font-extrabold tracking-[-0.01em] text-on-surface leading-none mb-8">
            Stop planning in spreadsheets. <span class="text-primary">Start making decisions.</span>
          </h1>
          <p class="text-lg font-body font-normal text-on-surface-variant leading-[1.7] max-w-prose mb-10">
            You have an ERP, but your planning still happens in fragile spreadsheets. Ceres normalizes messy customer data, catches exceptions automatically, and builds accurate AI forecasts — so you stop fighting Excel and start making decisions.
          </p>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4">
            <a href={import.meta.env.BASE_URL.endsWith("/") ? import.meta.env.BASE_URL + "book-a-demo/" : import.meta.env.BASE_URL + "/book-a-demo/"} class="btn-primary">
              Book a Custom Demo
            </a>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-16 grid grid-cols-3 gap-8 border-t border-outline-variant/20 pt-8">
            <div>
              <div class="font-mono font-light text-2xl text-on-surface data-mono">2 days</div>
              <div class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.18em] uppercase text-on-surface-variant mt-1">→ Seconds</div>
            </div>
            <div>
              <div class="font-mono font-light text-2xl text-on-surface data-mono">11x</div>
              <div class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.18em] uppercase text-on-surface-variant mt-1">Forecast Improvement</div>
            </div>
            <div>
              <div class="font-mono font-light text-2xl text-on-surface data-mono">Zero</div>
              <div class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.18em] uppercase text-on-surface-variant mt-1">Manual Reconciliation</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="lg:col-span-5 relative group">
          <div class="bg-surface-container p-1 ghost-border machined-gradient">
            <div class="bg-surface-container-lowest overflow-hidden border border-outline-variant/30 relative">
              <div class="h-8 bg-surface-container-high flex items-center px-3 justify-between">
                <div class="flex gap-1.5">
                  <div class="w-2 h-2 bg-on-surface-variant/20"></div>
                  <div class="w-2 h-2 bg-on-surface-variant/20"></div>
                  <div class="w-2 h-2 bg-on-surface-variant/20"></div>
                </div>
                <span class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.18em] uppercase text-on-surface-variant">Global Order Status</span>
              </div>
              <div class="aspect-square bg-surface relative">
                <img width="512" height="512" alt="Complex data visualization screen" class="w-full h-full object-cover opacity-60 mix-blend-screen" src={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}images/ec-hero-dashboard.jpg`} />
                <div class="absolute inset-0 p-4 pointer-events-none">
                  <div class="w-48 bg-surface-container/90 p-3 ghost-border">
                    <div class="section-label mb-2">Demand Signals</div>
                    <div class="space-y-2">
                      <div class="h-1 w-full bg-primary/20"></div>
                      <div class="h-1 w-2/3 bg-primary/20"></div>
                      <div class="h-1 w-3/4 bg-primary/20"></div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="absolute bottom-4 right-4 bg-surface-container/90 p-3 ghost-border">
                    <div class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.18em] uppercase text-on-surface-variant">Forecast Sync</div>
                    <div class="font-mono font-light text-xl text-on-surface data-mono">Active</div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- THE PROBLEM -->
    <section class="py-24 px-6 lg:px-12 bg-surface-container-low border-b border-outline-variant/10">
      <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
        <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-center">
          <div>
            <h2 class="font-headline font-extrabold tracking-[-0.01em] mb-6">The costly planning gap</h2>
            <p class="font-body font-normal text-on-surface-variant leading-[1.7] mb-8 max-w-prose">
              Between your SAP system and your actual supply chain decisions lies a massive gap. Right now, your team fills that gap by stitching together data by hand. When you supply multiple OEMs, manual planning breaks down.
            </p>
            <div class="space-y-6">
              <div class="flex gap-4 group">
                <div class="h-10 w-1 bg-primary group-hover:w-2 transition-all shrink-0"></div>
                <div>
                  <h4 class="font-headline font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.015em] text-on-surface">Mismatched Data</h4>
                  <p class="text-sm font-body font-normal text-on-surface-variant leading-[1.7]">Every customer sends demand in different formats, cadences, and time horizons.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="flex gap-4 group">
                <div class="h-10 w-1 bg-primary group-hover:w-2 transition-all shrink-0"></div>
                <div>
                  <h4 class="font-headline font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.015em] text-on-surface">High-SKU Complexity</h4>
                  <p class="text-sm font-body font-normal text-on-surface-variant leading-[1.7]">Managing thousands of part-customer-plant combinations crashes traditional spreadsheets.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="flex gap-4 group">
                <div class="h-10 w-1 bg-primary group-hover:w-2 transition-all shrink-0"></div>
                <div>
                  <h4 class="font-headline font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.015em] text-on-surface">Constant Fire Drills</h4>
                  <p class="text-sm font-body font-normal text-on-surface-variant leading-[1.7]">Unflagged demand shifts and missing data cause severe schedule volatility.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-surface-container-highest p-8 ghost-border">
            <div class="aspect-video bg-[#0B0E14] flex flex-col items-center justify-center p-6 border border-outline-variant/30 relative overflow-hidden">
              <div class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.18em] uppercase text-error mb-4">Critical: System Overload</div>
              <div class="w-full h-2 bg-error-container relative mb-2">
                <div class="absolute inset-y-0 left-0 bg-error w-full animate-pulse"></div>
              </div>
              <div class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.18em] uppercase text-on-surface-variant">Excel memory limit exceeded — manual override required</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- THE SOLUTION -->
    <section class="py-24 px-6 lg:px-12 bg-surface">
      <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
        <div class="mb-16">
          <h2 class="font-headline font-extrabold tracking-[-0.01em] mb-4">An automated planning layer</h2>
          <p class="font-body font-normal text-on-surface-variant leading-[1.7] max-w-prose">
            Ceres replaces your manual spreadsheets. We bring customer demand signals, ERP data, and historical demand into one intelligent system.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4">
          <div class="bg-surface-container p-6 machined-gradient hover:bg-surface-container-high transition-colors group flex flex-col">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary mb-6">input</span>
            <h3 class="font-headline font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.015em] text-on-surface mb-3">Ingest &amp; Normalize</h3>
            <p class="text-sm font-body font-normal text-on-surface-variant leading-[1.7] mb-6 flex-grow">
              Automatically pull in EDI signals, customer releases, and SAP snapshots to create one unified baseline.
            </p>
            <div class="section-label border-t border-outline-variant/20 pt-4">Outcome: stop manually reconciling files</div>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-surface-container p-6 machined-gradient hover:bg-surface-container-high transition-colors group flex flex-col">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary mb-6">warning</span>
            <h3 class="font-headline font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.015em] text-on-surface mb-3">Catch Exceptions</h3>
            <p class="text-sm font-body font-normal text-on-surface-variant leading-[1.7] mb-6 flex-grow">
              Automatically detect new part numbers, double plannings, and anomalous demand shifts that human eyes miss.
            </p>
            <div class="section-label border-t border-outline-variant/20 pt-4">Outcome: surface critical changes instantly</div>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-surface-container p-6 machined-gradient hover:bg-surface-container-high transition-colors group flex flex-col">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary mb-6">psychology</span>
            <h3 class="font-headline font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.015em] text-on-surface mb-3">AI Forecasting</h3>
            <p class="text-sm font-body font-normal text-on-surface-variant leading-[1.7] mb-6 flex-grow">
              Build accurate forecasts across every active part, customer, and plant combination at massive scale.
            </p>
            <div class="section-label border-t border-outline-variant/20 pt-4">Outcome: never skip a planning period</div>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-surface-container p-6 machined-gradient hover:bg-surface-container-high transition-colors group flex flex-col">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary mb-6">science</span>
            <h3 class="font-headline font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.015em] text-on-surface mb-3">Test Scenarios</h3>
            <p class="text-sm font-body font-normal text-on-surface-variant leading-[1.7] mb-6 flex-grow">
              Model the exact operational impact of new tariffs, logistics disruptions, or material shortages.
            </p>
            <div class="section-label border-t border-outline-variant/20 pt-4">Outcome: protect margins from chaos</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- THE OUTCOMES -->
    <section class="py-24 px-6 lg:px-12 border-t border-outline-variant/10">
      <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
        <div class="flex items-end justify-between mb-12">
          <div>
            <h2 class="font-headline font-extrabold tracking-[-0.01em] mb-2">Measurable ROI</h2>
            <div class="h-1 w-24 bg-primary"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
          <div class="bg-surface-container-low p-8 border border-outline-variant/20">
            <div class="font-mono font-light text-4xl text-on-surface mb-4 data-mono">2 days → 10 sec</div>
            <h4 class="font-headline font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.015em] text-primary mb-3">Time Back to Planners</h4>
            <p class="text-sm font-body font-normal text-on-surface-variant leading-[1.7]">What used to take a planner two days to reconcile now runs in seconds — so your team works on decisions, not data wrangling.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-surface-container-low p-8 border border-outline-variant/20">
            <div class="font-mono font-light text-4xl text-on-surface mb-4 data-mono">11x</div>
            <h4 class="font-headline font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.015em] text-primary mb-3">Forecast Improvement</h4>
            <p class="text-sm font-body font-normal text-on-surface-variant leading-[1.7]">Teams using Ceres have seen forecast accuracy improve 11x over traditional EDI-based planning — catching gaps before production locks in.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-surface-container-low p-8 border border-outline-variant/20">
            <div class="font-mono font-light text-4xl text-on-surface mb-4 data-mono">$0</div>
            <h4 class="font-headline font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.015em] text-primary mb-3">Avoidable Air Freight</h4>
            <p class="text-sm font-body font-normal text-on-surface-variant leading-[1.7]">Anomalies that used to cause $30K emergency air freight shipments get flagged automatically — before the damage is done.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- THE FIT -->
    <section class="py-24 px-6 lg:px-12 bg-surface-container-lowest">
      <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-16 items-center">
        <div class="w-full md:w-1/2">
          <img loading="lazy" width="512" height="512" alt="High-precision manufacturing" class="w-full grayscale brightness-50 contrast-125 ghost-border" src={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}images/ec-manufacturing.jpg`} />
        </div>
        <div class="w-full md:w-1/2 space-y-8">
          <h2 class="font-headline font-extrabold tracking-[-0.01em] text-on-surface leading-none">
            Built for complexity
          </h2>
          <p class="font-body font-normal text-on-surface-variant leading-[1.7] max-w-prose">
            Ceres is not a generic tool. It is designed specifically for supplier-side manufacturers managing multiple large customers, unpredictable demand formats, and extreme part-count complexity.
          </p>
          <div class="space-y-4">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-4 bg-surface-container-low p-4">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-outline">hub</span>
              <span class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.18em] uppercase text-on-surface">Multi-OEM Environment Native</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- FINAL CTA -->
    <section class="py-32 px-6 bg-[#0B0E14] text-center border-t border-outline-variant/10">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <h2 class="font-headline font-extrabold tracking-[-0.01em] mb-6 leading-none">Close the gap between your ERP and your decisions.</h2>
        <p class="font-body font-normal text-on-surface-variant text-lg mb-12 max-w-prose mx-auto leading-[1.7]">See how Ceres helps planning teams move faster, catch issues earlier, and make better decisions.</p>
        <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-center gap-4">
          <a href={import.meta.env.BASE_URL.endsWith("/") ? import.meta.env.BASE_URL + "book-a-demo/" : import.meta.env.BASE_URL + "/book-a-demo/"} class="btn-primary">
            See Ceres in action — Book a Demo
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>
</Layout>
